[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m 1. Expected value if a black ball is selected from bin A:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m     - Probability of selecting a black ball from bin A is $\frac{1}{5}$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m     - If black, probability of winning with $1$ or $7$ from bin B is $2/4 = 1/2$.  
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m     - For $1$: Probability $2/5$, so the expected value is $\frac{2}{5} \times 1 = \frac{2}{5}$.  
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m     - For $7$: Probability $2/5$, so the expected value is $\frac{2}{5} \times 7 = \frac{14}{5}$.  
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m     - Total expected value for bin A is $\frac{1}{5} \times \frac{2}{5} + \frac{1}{5} \times \frac{14}{5} = \frac{2}{5} + \frac{14}{25} = \frac{5}{25} + \frac{14}{25} = \frac{19}{25}$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m 2. Expected value if a white ball is selected from bin A:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m     - Probability of selecting a white ball from bin A is also $\frac{1}{5}$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m     - If white, probability of winning with $8$ or $500$ from bin W is $2/6$.  
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m     - For $8$: Probability $5/6$, so the expected value is $\frac{5}{6} \times 8 = \frac{40}{6} = \frac{20}{3}$.  
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m     - For $500$: Probability $1/6$, so the expected value is $\frac{1}{6} \times 500 = \frac{500}{6} = \frac{250}{3}$.  
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m     - Total expected value for bin A is $\frac{1}{5} \times \frac{20}{3} + \frac{1}{5} \times \frac{250}{3} = \frac{20}{15} + \frac{250}{15} = \frac{270}{15} = 18$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m 
