[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m 2) Meatballs, brownie: \$6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m 3) Cheeseburger and energy drink: \$4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m His goal is to end up with a net profit of 15% of the sales. If his orders total \$1,260 and he sells six cheeseburger/sandwiches, five meatball/sandwiches, and two energy drinks, how much of a profit does he want to make from the launch party?
