[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m Step 2: Calculate the probability of selecting a $\$1$ ball and a $\$7$ ball from Bin B.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m Probability of selecting a $\$1$ ball from Bin B = 3 out of 4 = 3/4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m Probability of selecting a $\$7$ ball from Bin B = 1 out of 4 = 1/4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m Step 3: Calculate the probability of selecting a $\$8$ ball and a $\$500$ ball from Bin W.
