[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m Probability of selecting a $\$500$ ball from Bin W = 1 out of 6 = 1/6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m Step 4: Calculate the expected win based on the given probabilities and winning amounts.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m Expected win for a black ball from Bin A = Probability of selecting a black ball from Bin A * Probability of selecting a $\$1$ ball from Bin B + Probability of selecting a black ball from Bin A * Probability of selecting a $\$7$ ball from Bin B = (4/5) * (3/4) + (4/5) * (1/4) = 3/5 + 4/20 = 6/10 + 4/20 = 2/5
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m Expected win for a white ball from Bin A = Probability of selecting a white ball from Bin A * Probability of selecting a $\$8$ ball from Bin W + Probability of selecting a white ball from Bin A * Probability of selecting a $\$500$ ball from Bin W = (1/5) * (5/6) + (1/5) * (1/6) = 5/30 + 1/30 = 6/30 = 1/5
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m Step 5: Calculate the weighted average of the expected wins for both cases.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m Expected win = (Probability of selecting a black ball from Bin A * Expected win for a black ball from Bin A) + (Probability of selecting a white ball from Bin A * Expected win for a white ball from Bin A)
