[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m - $B_W$: Event of selecting a white ball from bin $B$,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m - $B_A$: Event of selecting a black ball from bin $A$,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m - $B_A+W$: Event of selecting a white ball from bin $A$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2273099)[0m Then,
